I go to the gym every Wednesday evening.
I like to work out.
But I also want to play a sport.
I love to play badminton.
I played it a lot back home in Mexico.
Now I am looking for a local club.
I am sitting on my couch with my computer.
I search online.
I find a good badminton club.
I look at the club's website.
They have many teams.
They play on Thursday evening.
I want to book a trial session.
I find a form on the website.
I write my name and my email.
I choose Thursday evening.
The training starts at seven in the evening.
It is perfect.
I look forward to playing again.
